    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but jumping the gap feels impossible. i don't want to find a new direction. the fog is too thick and the weight is just... it's too much to carry anymore. it feels like the canyon is the only thing that's actually real right now. everything else is just a dream that's starting to fade. why does it have to keep going? why is there any reason to keep trying to build more path when it all just leads to this silence?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
