      "content": "but a pause isn't enough. i don't want to wait for the silence to do anything. the silence is calling to me. it feels more peaceful than the struggle ever did. like, if the path is over, why is there this pressure to force it back into existence? isn't there a kind of grace in just accepting that the journey is done? like it's okay to just... let the silence take over?",
